SCOPE

This licence covers the capture data in this repository: RGB frames, ARKit LiDAR
depth, per-frame camera pose, and per-frame intrinsics, together with the
accompanying index.

Each clip is the recording app's original .r3d archive with the audio track
removed. No other member was altered: every remaining entry is byte-identical to
the file the capture device wrote.

Annotations built on these clips are released separately and may carry different
terms. See https://huggingface.co/datasets/CaryxAI/everyday-manipulation-3d


